{"4684140": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Tax Empire", "steam_appid": 4684140, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [5100120], "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build Your Tax Empire</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start with a single house and grow your city through taxation. Construct new buildings, add floors to existing ones and multiply your tax income with every investment as you build your own tax empire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4684140/extras/75b6efa99282a0e178f13c4419269aae.poster.avif?t=1787990986\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4684140/extras/75b6efa99282a0e178f13c4419269aae.webm?t=1787990986\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4684140/extras/75b6efa99282a0e178f13c4419269aae.mp4?t=1787990986\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Iron Fist</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each new ability unlocks another way to collect more taxes. Empower your tax officers, upgrade buildings, control traffic, raise tax rates and rule your city with an iron fist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4684140/extras/878cb47c91a2c6619073be78f536373b.poster.avif?t=1787990986\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4684140/extras/878cb47c91a2c6619073be78f536373b.webm?t=1787990986\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4684140/extras/878cb47c91a2c6619073be78f536373b.mp4?t=1787990986\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Assign Tax Officers</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use tax officers to oversee larger areas, apply additional taxes, and generate income from every corner of your city.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4684140/extras/138c231bb24d1977492a60a8d5ee4851.poster.avif?t=1787990986\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4684140/extras/138c231bb24d1977492a60a8d5ee4851.webm?t=1787990986\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4684140/extras/138c231bb24d1977492a60a8d5ee4851.mp4?t=1787990986\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Enact New Laws</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Power is in your hands. Pass new laws to reshape the tax system in your favor, increase the burden on the people and put powerful policies into effect to multiply your income.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4684140/extras/de9c9c5d780b4a4d61f8aad302c1a16c.poster.avif?t=1787990986\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4684140/extras/de9c9c5d780b4a4d61f8aad302c1a16c.webm?t=1787990986\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4684140/extras/de9c9c5d780b4a4d61f8aad302c1a16c.mp4?t=1787990986\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Don’t forget to add “Tax Empire” to your wishlist on Steam!</strong></h2>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build Your Tax Empire</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start with a single house and grow your city through taxation. Construct new buildings, add floors to existing ones and multiply your tax income with every investment as you build your own tax empire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4684140/extras/75b6efa99282a0e178f13c4419269aae.poster.avif?t=1787990986\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4684140/extras/75b6efa99282a0e178f13c4419269aae.webm?t=1787990986\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4684140/extras/75b6efa99282a0e178f13c4419269aae.mp4?t=1787990986\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Iron Fist</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each new ability unlocks another way to collect more taxes. Empower your tax officers, upgrade buildings, control traffic, raise tax rates and rule your city with an iron fist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4684140/extras/878cb47c91a2c6619073be78f536373b.poster.avif?t=1787990986\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4684140/extras/878cb47c91a2c6619073be78f536373b.webm?t=1787990986\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4684140/extras/878cb47c91a2c6619073be78f536373b.mp4?t=1787990986\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Assign Tax Officers</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use tax officers to oversee larger areas, apply additional taxes, and generate income from every corner of your city.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4684140/extras/138c231bb24d1977492a60a8d5ee4851.poster.avif?t=1787990986\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4684140/extras/138c231bb24d1977492a60a8d5ee4851.webm?t=1787990986\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4684140/extras/138c231bb24d1977492a60a8d5ee4851.mp4?t=1787990986\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Enact New Laws</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Power is in your hands. Pass new laws to reshape the tax system in your favor, increase the burden on the people and put powerful policies into effect to multiply your income.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4684140/extras/de9c9c5d780b4a4d61f8aad302c1a16c.poster.avif?t=1787990986\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4684140/extras/de9c9c5d780b4a4d61f8aad302c1a16c.webm?t=1787990986\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4684140/extras/de9c9c5d780b4a4d61f8aad302c1a16c.mp4?t=1787990986\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Don’t forget to add “Tax Empire” to your wishlist on Steam!</strong></h2>", "short_description": "Build your own Tax Empire! Collect taxes, expand your city, hire tax officers, control traffic, enact new policies and squeeze out as much revenue as you can on your road t